[14231]="700536B7\n1\tYou may complete this quest at any time.\t\n",
[14232]="70015786\n1\tAid Hadi\030Aid Gúri\030Aid Bési\tGúri, Hadi,and Bési are all at the camp in the Fanged Pit. Folkath wants you to help the dwarves of Durin's Way in their efforts against the merrevail.\n2\tTalk to Folkath at the Fanged Pit camp\tFolkath is at the Fanged Pit, east of Jazârgund. Folkath will be interested to know what you learned from helping Hadi, Bési, and Gúri.\n",
[14233]="7002CA8F\n1\tTalk to the visitor in the clearing, far to the north-east\tThe clearing can be found in the north-east section of the Wailing Hills, north of Aster Hill. Penda has mentioned meeting unexpected visitors in a clearing far to the north.\n",
[14234]="70067CAC\n1\tFind the dwarf emissary and his company\tIthurga's concern over the arrival of an emissary and his entourage from Umbar might be an ill-omen and asked that you enquire after his purpose in Halrax.\n2\tIntroduce yourself to the dwarf emissary and ask why he is in Halrax\tAs you searched Halrax's docks, you spied the dwarf and his entourage. Make your introductions and enquire why they are in Halrax.\n3\tGive the dwarf your word of secrecy\tYou have a decision to make. Learn why the dwarf is here in Halrax and bind yourself to secrecy or refuse and fail in the task Ithurga assigned.\n4\tTalk to Bekhel\tYou made your intention clear. The dwarf is prepared to inform you of his purpose in Halrax. Speak with him.\n",
[14235]="70072519\n1\tComplete the Instance: The Road to Adagím\tRhadrog and Faeron ask that you gain Viznak's insight and input on the story of the King's Folly and the map you discovered. Perhaps the goblin can tell you how the story may coincide with the blight he studies in Adagím.\n2\tDeliver Bêtam's map to Viznak at Sul Madásh\tYou made a harrowing journey through the wilds of Mûr Ghala, beset by spiders, Orcs, trolls, and a morvul. At the journey's end a friendly face appeared, the goblin Viznak. He wishes to speak to you in Sul Madásh in Adagím.\n",
[14236]="700400F4\n1\tFind and confront Nerzus about the invader in Blackroot Vale\tNerzus can be found atop the Hill of Erech. Gúrion has asked you to find and confront the leader of the Dead in Blackroot Vale and question him about the invader.\n2\tTalk to Gúrion\tGúrion can be found in Lancrath in south-eastern Blackroot Vale. You have defeated the leader of the Dead in the vale, but before he vanished, he delivered a grim warning to the people of Gondor.\n",
[14237]="7006C6F7\n1\tComplete Instance: Voice on the Wind\tRaphûz asked for your assistance in finding, assisting, and apologizing to Ashâmi. He will lead you to the withered grove to the south from his home in Jirush.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tAshâmi led you and Raphûz out of the withered grove to the south-east where you arrived at Shoníth, a hidden oasis and home to the Kintai Elves. Raphûz looks like he wants to speak to you.\n",
[14238]="700169EC\n1\tRead Laerdan's note\tYou should read Laerdan's note before opening the parcel he left for you. You spoke to Failloth in Rivendell and learned that Laerdan had left a note and a parcel behind for you in his room.\n2\tTalk to Failloth\tFailloth is in the courtyard of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. You have read Laerdan's note and should speak now to Failloth.\n",
[14239]="700187C2\n1\tRead Laerdan's note\tYou should read Laerdan's note before opening the parcel he left for you. You spoke to Failloth in Rivendell and learned that Laerdan had left a note and a parcel behind for you in his room.\n2\tTalk to Failloth\tFailloth is in the courtyard of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. You have read Laerdan's note and should speak now to Failloth.\n",
[14240]="7001CC81\n1\tTalk to a Galadhrim Guard outside the gates of Caras Galadhon and complete 'The Paths of Caras Galadhon'\tNúrelleth can be found on Telain Glorelloth, where the flets extend over the hedge that encircles Caras Galadhon. Gruingalas has asked you to give the sad news of Achardor's fall to Núrelleth, his brother's widow.\n2\tTalk to Núrelleth on Telain Glorelloth\tNúrelleth can be found on Telain Glorelloth, where the flets extend over the hedge that encircles Caras Galadhon. Gruingalas has asked you to give the sad news of Achardor's fall to Núrelleth, his brother's widow\n3\tTalk to Galadriel at the House of Celeborn\tGaladriel is at the House of Celeborn, in Caras Galadhon. Núrelleth has asked you to speak with Galadriel if you have unanswered questions about Achardor's fate.\n",
})
